{"meta":{"id":"tt33317800","type":"series","name":"Secrets of the Silent Witch","imdb_id":"tt33317800","description":"Monica Everett, la Bruja Silenciosa, es la única practicante del mundo de la Magia sin Voz, una auténtica heroína que, sin ayuda de nadie, combatió contra el Dragón Negro de la leyenda. Sin embargo, la joven portento es en realidad... ¡supertímida! Sí, resulta que aprendió Magia Sin Voz para evitar hablar en público. Sin saberlo, los Siete Sabios le han encomendado una misión secreta para proteger al Segundo Príncipe. ¿Podrá Mónica mantener la compostura mientras se enfrenta tanto a la vida social como a los males que acechan al joven miembro de la realeza?","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt33317800.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6yC53NuAwy8KhbzsrZ7NDFsSg2p.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7GFhMVmgYQwIhSeHBUJiXY452ET.png","genres":["Animación","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-07-05T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.6","country":"Japan","cast":["会沢紗弥","生天目仁美","Shogo Sakata","Yoshiki Nakajima","Ryohei Kimura","Yuki Sakakihara","Yoko Hikasa","Kanna Nakamura","Hina Suguta","Ai Kayano","Atsumi Tanezaki","Junichi Suwabe","M・A・O","Shunichi Toki"],"writer":["依空まつり","金崎貴臣"],"trailers":[{"source":"0OBF29HoV4A","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"0OBF29HoV4A","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"0OBF29HoV4A","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.6","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt33317800"},{"name":"Animación","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Animaci%C3%B3n"},{"name":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Sci-Fi+%26+Fantasy"},{"name":"会沢紗弥","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search